## Claim under pressure

SPRINT **T5** (std honesty + ship):

| Slice | Path-A expectation |
|-------|--------------------|
| Committed secrets / API keys / private keys | **None** in `std/` or `ooda/std` working tree or git index |
| `.env` / dotenv / credential files | Absent; gitignored |
| Cap-bypass / cap-strip scripts | Absent (`patch_awk`, `boot_dbg*`, `*cap_strip*`, `*cap_bypass*`) |
| Gated crypto honesty | No "PRODUCTION READY" greenwash next to `process_exit` (smoke gate) |
| Supply-chain binaries | No tracked ELF/so/host tools under std |

Adversarial stance: treat every `secret_key` / hex blob / `password` string as a
**candidate leak** until classified as type API, public curve constant, or dummy
verify padding. Treat gitignore alone as **not** a seal without index proof.

