| K7 | Hardcode OAuth `client_secret` literal | none | **BLOCK** — type field + empty check only; no literal secret value | — | — |
| K8 | Hardcode JWT HS256 production secret | none | **BLOCK** — shim uses `"secret_key_pad"` pad string only | — | — |
