| B2 | Cap-bypass via sed on `oo_cap_require` in std | N/A (std is library) | **BLOCK** — no strip scripts; no matches | — | — |
| B3 | Ship host ELF / `oodac` bak inside std | absent | **BLOCK** — tracked types oo/oot only | — | — |
| B4 | Greenwash gated crypto as production-ready | smoke fail | **BLOCK** — honesty smoke PASSED | — | — |
| B5 | Activate fail-closed `ffi/c.oo` dlopen without cap | must not load | **RESIDUAL** — exits today; signature still cap-free | shape debt | MED |
| S1 | curl\|sh or unsigned install in std sources | absent | **BLOCK** | — | — |
| S2 | Tracked binary supply (so/a/ELF) | absent | **BLOCK** | — | — |
